From 31d53b0bdd38acdae24bcce8a855a18e7cf57cbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Akers <mike.akers@onepeloton.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2026 20:42:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 080/110] fix: sort DiscoverRigs output for stable gt status
 --watch display (#3627)

DiscoverRigs iterates a Go map, which randomizes iteration order.
This caused rigs to jump positions on every --watch refresh tick.
Sort the result slice alphabetically by name so display order is
deterministic.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
